# Secrets and environment variables
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Atomic-write temp files (crates/core/src/envgov.rs). These hold the COMPLETE
# new file — real credential values included — if a crash lands between the
# write and the rename. For `.env` the name is `..env.api-tracker-tmp-<uuid>`,
# which neither `.env` nor `.env.*` matches (NEW-29).
.*.api-tracker-tmp-*

